## Working on it

You need Node.js ({{ '22.23.4' if framework == 'astro' else '22.18' }} or later on 22, or 24.12 or later) and [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/installation), which switches itself to the version `packageManager` names in `package.json`.

```sh
pnpm install
```
